{"2666530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BIG SHOTS", "steam_appid": 2666530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Community!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/3206110d264247d2330115d342cb9840.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>An experiment gone wrong unleashed a relentless alien invasion, plunging humanity into chaos. Price Inc. initiated the <strong>BIG SHOTS</strong> Initiative to fight the invaders; this is where you come in, rookie. Become a Big Shot and take on the pivotal role of an alien exterminator. As you gear up and evolve your mech, you’ll venture deeper into infested areas in search of the source of all this mayhem.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/8a55ed1b1a9d0e7b2209653b335f64d6.poster.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/8a55ed1b1a9d0e7b2209653b335f64d6.webm?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/8a55ed1b1a9d0e7b2209653b335f64d6.mp4?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/f805ddd9bad8ee9544c04720be11ade6.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>Exterminations can be done solo or side by side with a fellow big shot. When teamed up, working together is key to holding off alien scum and getting the job done. Cross-platform play is supported, so none of your friends will be left out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/0077de475b397cd4868219ce6cacd7ea.poster.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/0077de475b397cd4868219ce6cacd7ea.webm?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/0077de475b397cd4868219ce6cacd7ea.mp4?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/ada1c923dfff245097ac28b56d871d20.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>Evolve your humble mech with upgrades during runs, becoming the ultimate alien exterminator in your crazy rogue-lite adventure. Explore the possibilities and combinations from the upgrades presented to you, or change your loadout with the permanent upgrades that you can acquire in the shop back at the hangar!<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/2029af45e6fecc509059723d1219dc27.poster.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/2029af45e6fecc509059723d1219dc27.webm?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/2029af45e6fecc509059723d1219dc27.mp4?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/000ae57b6f9af0538eb2c4cb499387e6.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>BIG SHOTS® is a fresh take on the popular wave shooter &amp; roguelite genre in virtual reality. Take advantage of our innovative movement system to move around freely in a swift, immersive, and comfortable manner. No more standing in predefined positions or being restricted by teleportation, but unlimited mobility and opportunities at your disposal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/14431736c29cc8b263f8bd8f2a580344.poster.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/14431736c29cc8b263f8bd8f2a580344.webm?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/14431736c29cc8b263f8bd8f2a580344.mp4?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/3206110d264247d2330115d342cb9840.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>An experiment gone wrong unleashed a relentless alien invasion, plunging humanity into chaos. Price Inc. initiated the <strong>BIG SHOTS</strong> Initiative to fight the invaders; this is where you come in, rookie. Become a Big Shot and take on the pivotal role of an alien exterminator. As you gear up and evolve your mech, you’ll venture deeper into infested areas in search of the source of all this mayhem.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/8a55ed1b1a9d0e7b2209653b335f64d6.poster.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/8a55ed1b1a9d0e7b2209653b335f64d6.webm?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/8a55ed1b1a9d0e7b2209653b335f64d6.mp4?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/f805ddd9bad8ee9544c04720be11ade6.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>Exterminations can be done solo or side by side with a fellow big shot. When teamed up, working together is key to holding off alien scum and getting the job done. Cross-platform play is supported, so none of your friends will be left out!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/0077de475b397cd4868219ce6cacd7ea.poster.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/0077de475b397cd4868219ce6cacd7ea.webm?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/0077de475b397cd4868219ce6cacd7ea.mp4?t=1740659713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666530/extras/ada1c923dfff245097ac28b56d871d20.avif?t=1740659713\" width=600 height=238 /></span><br>Evolve your humble mech with upgrades during runs, becoming the ultimate alien exterminator in your crazy rogue-lite adventure. Explore the possibilities and combinations from the upgrades presented to you, or change your loadout with the permanent upgrades that you can acquire in the shop back at the hangar!<br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"